  "releaseHighlights": "- Up to 20 looks per node (Lite keeps 3).\n- New Skin Tone Selector and Perfect Exposure, with face detection and a built-in vectorscope.\n- New Compare: wipe or side by side against a second input or a held frame.\n- New Look Board: a control window with your looks, stills, Hold from Still and Apply to All Clips. Mac only for now.\n- New Look Scopes in their own window, fed straight from the node: 3D cube, CIE, vectorscopes, waveform, histogram, blacks. Drag panes around and save your own layouts. Mac only for now.\n- New Stream Deck plugin for switching looks and skin views. Mac only for now.\n- Starting Point: save your own defaults.\n- Windows and Linux now run on the GPU with OpenCL as well as CUDA, and get face detection.\n- Saved projects keep their looks, notes and settings.",
