      "releaseHighlights": "- Free. No licence key, no watermark, no sign up.\n- Eight looks, each with its own label and notes, burned right into the image so the client always knows which look they are seeing.\n- Change Active Look and Look Notes flips your look nodes for you: label a node to match the look (or just \"Look 1\", \"Look 2\") and it turns on while the others turn off.\n- Works on clip nodes and at the timeline level, and a repeated label across a split look flips every matching node together.\n- Position: Bottom, Top or Center, plus PowerGrade Mode that fills the frame with just the label so Gallery stills show which look they hold.\n- Garamond, Pixel or your own fonts, with colour, size, opacity and alignment controls.\n- How To Set Up button opens a step by step guide.\n- Runs on the GPU. macOS universal Metal build, Windows and Linux CUDA builds.",
